{"reviews":[{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-0","r":1.0,"t":"Real Garbage Lip Product","x":"This is one of the worst lip products I have ever used.Sticky and as uncomfortable as it can be .The taste is just awful.I had to take it off it made me sick.Try Chapstick total hydration.There is no comparison.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-1","r":4.0,"t":"Meh","x":"It\u2019s very sticky. I\u2019m not overly impressed.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-2","r":5.0,"t":"One of my favorite Flower products!","x":"This lip mask feels great and keep my lips hydrated. I've tried it in colors but I prefer the clear as I can use it by itself or put a touch on over lipstick to give it more shine and keep my lips moist. I highly recommend!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-3","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE this","x":"This product is thick without feeling heavy. Tastes great too. I actually use it as a lip mask so I just put it on before bed rather than wearing it throughout the day. I wake up with lovely soft lips!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-4","r":3.0,"t":"YouTube made me buy it!","x":"Pretty lip balm and it's sheer.  Does not  last long nor make my lips smoother.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-5","r":3.0,"t":"On the fence on this.","x":"I am so torn on this. The smell is very \"perfumey\", which is a negative and it runs out so fast. There is very little product especially for something that is 10 bucks. I LOVE the texture though. It really is moisturizing and gives a nice sheen. It makes the lips look so healthy and juicy. At this point I don't know if I will re-buy. I probably won't and will try to look for some sort of dupe.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-6","r":3.0,"t":"Bummer!  Not a Black Honey Dupe","x":"I snagged the Sangria thinking it would be a dupe to Clinique Almost lipstick in black honey. Drew layering it on on her Insta made it look just like the cult favorite. Unfortunately it is not. It\u2019s vey sheer with little color. Cool tube makes it a neater way to apply that lip gloss shine!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-7","r":4.0,"t":"stay put shine and sheer color!","x":"This is a heavier product than I anticipated, yet it provides a sheer color, shine and stays put for hours. I am pleasantly surprised! though it has a fragrance, there is no flavor (a plus in my book). I anticipate this will be my new go-to tinted gloss!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-8","r":4.0,"t":"Got the wrong item","x":"I love this gloss and have purchased it many times but this last time i ordered two in the shade nectar but they sent me one in nectar and one in another shade but their sticker that they stuck on the back says its nectar but its not","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-9","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE THESE!!","x":"Clever packaging (stays fresh-doesn\u2019t melt or get old); great pricing- love the formulations: they taste good, just the right amount of color/shimmer, and make my lips feel great!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-10","r":5.0,"t":"Great balm","x":"This balm has really softened my lips. It has a sweet, fruity smell and a hint of glitter.  I have already bought 3 of these and will prolly get more.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-11","r":3.0,"t":"Very strong, perfumey smell","x":"I bought the color Lucky. Seems to moisturize ok. I am VERY smell sensitive and allergic to almost any product that has any kind of fragrance added. While this has not caused any kind of allergic reaction yet, it has such a strong perfume smell to it, I don't think I'm going to be able to wear it. It smells like a very cloying, heavy perfume w/amber, musk or something of that type. Does not smell at all like honey. The smell makes me nauseous & gives me a headache. Very disappointed. The smell i","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-12","r":4.0,"t":"Long lasting and  feels great","x":"This is a very nice product. The smell is so lovely, feels great on and lasts better than other lip glosses. Few things fall short,,,I don\u2019t think it will last long it\u2019s a small amount and the tube is a bit messy looking. But it\u2019s so lovely and pricing is great so I will buy more soon.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-13","r":3.0,"t":"I prefer Almay's Butterkiss balms, on several levels","x":"Nice, moisturizing tinted lip balm, but it doesn't last very long (about 15 days).  I won't be buying again, will stick with Almay Butterkiss products,  as they are cheaper, last for MONTHS, and the tint is more obvious and lasts a bit longer on my lips.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-14","r":2.0,"t":"Sadly mine was bad.","x":"LOVE DREW!! But sadly did not love this product. I'm not sure if it was old or maybe improperly stored but it actually had a rancid odor. Couldn't return it due to my health risk factors, it a shame because I had hoped to like it based on reviews.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-15","r":1.0,"t":"SMELLS LIKE WAX","x":"This has got to be expired because it smells like straight up wax. The other color I got was great but this was horrible. The color is beautiful so it sucks that I\u2019m going to have to toss it. A replacement or refund would be great","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-16","r":5.0,"t":"Such a steal!!!","x":"Worth wat more than the $5 price tag.  Actually performs more like a high-end balm you would get at a luxury retailer.  I got the shade with subtle Gold sparkles and it is beautiful alone or on top of the deeper shade.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-17","r":4.0,"t":"Great color, watch the applicator","x":"This color is lovely and sheer. The applicator requires some attention, it\u2019s very easy for too much to come out, but I\u2019ve figured out how to avoid wasting any product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-18","r":1.0,"t":"Horrible smell","x":"The color and texture is ok but the smell makes me feel extremely uncomfortable. Too lazy to return a used product but the smell is way too overwhelming to keep using.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-19","r":4.0,"t":"Great product!","x":"Love this product!! I am going to get more colors. Lips stay soft and hydrated long after application.  I hate wearing lipstick. This is the perfect product for me","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-20","r":4.0,"t":"Great product!","x":"Love this product!! I am going to get more colors. Lips stay soft and hydrated long after application.  I hate wearing lipstick. This is the perfect product for me","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-21","r":4.0,"t":"Great product!","x":"Love this product!! I am going to get more colors. Lips stay soft and hydrated long after application.  I hate wearing lipstick. This is the perfect product for me","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-22","r":4.0,"t":"Great product!","x":"Love this product!! I am going to get more colors. Lips stay soft and hydrated long after application.  I hate wearing lipstick. This is the perfect product for me","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-23","r":5.0,"t":"Fantastic for older ladies who need moisture and nourishment","x":"Everything a girl could want on her lips!  Some shine, some translucent color and tons of healing, healthiness that stays on your lips.  Thank you Drew!!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B084QB5Q5G-24","r":2.0,"t":"Lame","x":"Disappointed! It\u2019s feels like a lip gloss at first then thickens which is nice. No tint at all and I got nectar. Over priced and not worth it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the product moisturizing and softening for their lips.","cites":[3,4,6,11,13]},{"text":"A common complaint is a strong, perfumey fragrance or unpleasant taste/smell.","cites":[1,6,12,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers describe the texture as sticky or heavy.","cites":[1,2,8]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the product runs out quickly or doesn't last long.","cites":[5,6,13,14]},{"text":"Reviewers praise the sheer color, shine, and long-lasting wear.","cites":[8,10,13]}]},"qa":[]}